{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/473aae320e1d5a40ba3fad87efecbf93.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/195f02037653bf1bd2584ade0de59c48.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kino Konoe, a pawnbroker's daughter, catches a cold and tries to take medicine, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medicine she takes is a &quot;time capsule&quot; that was sold at pawnbrokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks it, she will travel back in time to the present day...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/047e21c111778d878c741fd2b7fd9ec6.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she meets a wonderful man named Kazama, but it ends up being a dream at the best part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks the &quot;time capsule&quot; again, she should be able to meet him again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then two ninjas who are after it and a samurai who helps her appear...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/cc52b1bdb030a67c523557eb5adb80a7.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of friendship and love between a ninja and a samurai!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Shinobi Samurai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target: All ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language: Japanese, English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of players: 1 (no internet)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings: 3 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stills and pictures: 15</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837990?t=1752497247","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837990?t=1752497247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/c2a972aa1f10e0edffcf0c0b8bcb914129caf9ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752497247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/c2a972aa1f10e0edffcf0c0b8bcb914129caf9ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752497247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/473aae320e1d5a40ba3fad87efecbf93.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/195f02037653bf1bd2584ade0de59c48.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kino Konoe, a pawnbroker's daughter, catches a cold and tries to take medicine, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medicine she takes is a &quot;time capsule&quot; that was sold at pawnbrokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks it, she will travel back in time to the present day...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"